{"version":1,"content":"<p>日劇天王木村拓哉25歲長笛演奏家大女心美(Cocomi)，去年被爆秘戀30歲排球運動員小川智大。</p><p>今年9月，心美秘密飛波蘭會當地打波的男友後，近日網上再流出她疑在賽後與男友當眾抱抱的片段。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;片中小川賽</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T15:24:02.835032+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T15:03:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T15:17:14.922500+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T15:17:14.922500+00:00","content_hash":"086daf59858f69b903338c913e0cfbee5aebc593b95452d22f1a8ad4e1262efe","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}